WEBVTT

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:38.010
A Sorrowful Spell is When One Is Transformed by Memories!

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:38.010
Pokaan ~ 23

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:45.120
Oh, VHS!

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:46.520
That's nostalgic.

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:50.830
Just how many generations old is this thing?

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:53.150
You actually managed to keep it in storage for that long?

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:57.200
Pachira-san, that's terrible!

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:01.240
To me, any machine is a cute comrade!

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:03.040
How could I throw it away?

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:05.930
S-sorry... really.

00:01:05.930 --> 00:01:07.880
You're right, you're right...

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:19.840
Hey, there's a tape inside.

00:01:20.950 --> 00:01:25.020
Oh, this tape has my memories stored inside it.

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:27.020
Memories?

00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:31.020
I wonder what kind of memories are inside!

00:01:33.690 --> 00:01:36.830
I don't think you should be asking us.

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:40.040
Um... maybe you should plug it into the TV and watch?

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.540
Oh, you're right!

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:48.540
Um... um...

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:52.090
Huh? There's nowhere to plug it in, is there...

00:01:55.610 --> 00:01:57.500
What's could be wrong?

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:02.850
Sorry to have to tell you this, Aiko, but could it be that it's just too old?

00:02:03.150 --> 00:02:06.380
Aww, maybe you're right.

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:08.550
That's too bad.

00:02:08.550 --> 00:02:11.260
I wanted to check what was on the tape.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:15.690
Hey, hey, hey! Guess what!

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:19.360
They're going to be rebroadcasting Makai-chan starting today!

00:02:21.730 --> 00:02:24.300
Really? I've missed that show!

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:26.640
We all watched that show when we were young!

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:29.450
What? I've never watched such a program.

00:02:29.450 --> 00:02:31.380
Did something like that ever air?

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:34.580
Jeez.... there's no way you couldn't have watched it!

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:37.340
Everyone in the netherworld was hooked!

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.390
I remember pretending to be like them and playing around...

00:02:41.730 --> 00:02:43.340
Yeah...

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:48.150
These clothes are based on the costume of the heroine!

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:49.390
Did you know that?

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:52.220
It was that popular?

00:02:52.220 --> 00:02:55.320
Then, I'll probably remember once I watch it.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:56.860
So, when does it air?

00:02:57.380 --> 00:02:59.510
5:30 in the evening, right?

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:00.990
Let's all watch it!

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:01.860
Okay!

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:03.120
Hm?

00:03:04.380 --> 00:03:05.850
What kind of machine is that?

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:07.620
It's a VCR.

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:11.340
Wow! Who bought this? When did you buy this?

00:03:11.340 --> 00:03:14.400
Yes! Now we'll be able to videotape it!

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:16.130
We can watch it whenever we want!

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:18.680
Well...

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:19.970
We can't do that...

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:24.100
Eh? Why not?

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:26.220
Isn't that a VCR?

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:29.800
Yes, but we're unable to plug it in.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:33.050
It seems to be a fairly dated machine, so...

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:39.190
Then, I'll do something about it!

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:42.060
Ah, stop, stop.

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:45.200
I respectfully decline your magic.

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:47.560
It might have been used but it was still expensive!

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:48.700
It's a digital TV!

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:54.710
So that TV is digital?

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:57.710
Digital?

00:03:57.710 --> 00:03:59.920
How to plug in a monaural
VHS tape player

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:07.530
It says we need a DA converter to connect an analog tape player.

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:10.120
That's why we weren't able to plug it in!

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:11.480
Thank goodness....

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:14.190
What was so good about that?

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:18.160
It's not that my tape player is unusable, it's...

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:20.160
That's not good at all!

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:22.940
We need to buy one of those DA converters quick!

00:04:22.940 --> 00:04:26.200
So, will 500 yen be enough?

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:29.960
You really don't know much about this...

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:32.210
It'll probably cost about 2000 yen.

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:34.780
What? That much?

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:35.770
What'll we do?

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:37.770
My heart's starting to thump...

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:40.210
Then, if we all pitch in 500...

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:43.960
Can't you just watch the broadcast?

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:46.140
How can you turn your back on me like that?

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:48.220
Um... turning my back on you...?

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:52.720
We already have this tape player, so why not record the show?

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:53.580
C'mon!

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:57.130
Um, and I would like a DA converter, too.

00:04:57.130 --> 00:05:00.730
If we have one, I can watch what's on my video, as well.

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:02.620
That's right!

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:04.240
Yeah, you're right.

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:07.320
If we're all right about this, then let's go buy it!

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:13.160
Eko Amanaka
Electric Company

00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:13.160
DA converter?

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.460
Hm... don't have one...

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:18.200
No one really uses those anymore, you know.

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:20.670
If the maker still has them in stock, I'll order one for you.

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:22.960
But it'll take about ten days.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.460
Ten days?

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:27.610
What's wrong?  You in a hurry?

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:29.850
We want one now.

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:31.960
We want to record Makai-chan!

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:33.180
Is that so...

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:35.620
Well then, why not try going to Akiba?

00:05:37.260 --> 00:05:40.190
If you went there, I'm sure you could find something.

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:47.330
What? We're supposed to find something HERE?

00:05:47.330 --> 00:05:49.640
I have a feeling we're going to get lost.

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:50.730
Uma, at least.

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:54.770
But if there are this many stores around, I'm sure we'll be able to find it!

00:05:54.770 --> 00:05:55.440
Yeah, probab-

00:05:55.440 --> 00:05:56.290
Wow!

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:58.290
Hey, we're going, Uma!

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:00.600
Look, there's a maid over there!

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:02.710
I wonder whose maid that is!

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:07.080
Hey, we came here to look for a DA converter, didn't we?

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:09.580
Don't get distracted by other things!

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:11.100
Try to take things seriously for once!

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:12.720
I know!

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:16.140
Hey, hey, do you have a DA converter?

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:20.690
She doesn't understand at all...

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.580
The big-volume sellers don't have it.

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:39.460
The mid-range AV shops aren't any good either.

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:45.450
If we go to the smaller stores, we end up wasting a lot of time.

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:52.540
Hm... Tasogare-ya might have one in stock.

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:56.480
If you go to the second corner over there and take a left, you'll find a narrow alley.

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:57.930
It's all the way down that.

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:02.600
If they don't have one, you're best off just giving up and letting it go.

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:04.900
Thank you very much!

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:14.450
Excuse me... Do you have a video DA converter?

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:15.630
What?

00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:18.910
Hm... I might have one left somewhere around here...

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:21.880
One second!

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:22.760
We did it!

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:23.810
Converter!

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:25.730
It looks like we finally found it!

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:27.330
That's Akiba for you.

00:07:27.330 --> 00:07:28.460
Pretty incredible.

00:07:29.540 --> 00:07:32.470
This is our last one. You guys got lucky.

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:33.940
Yeah!

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:35.580
That'll be 47,000 yen.

00:07:37.760 --> 00:07:40.430
I-I can go down to 40,000, I guess...

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:43.940
They're that expensive?

00:07:48.920 --> 00:07:52.220
I understand how you feel, but that really won't be enough...

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:53.530
I'm sorry.

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:07.090
I guess it was useless.

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:08.500
I'm feeling so downhearted.

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:11.060
Well there was nothing we could do about it.

00:08:11.060 --> 00:08:14.570
We can see the live broadcast, so it's fine.

00:08:14.570 --> 00:08:16.480
We can't tape it, though...

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:21.020
That's right. It's nothing compared to the tape that Aiko can't watch.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:24.480
I guess so...

00:08:25.240 --> 00:08:29.160
Hey, didn't the tape have "memories" on the label?

00:08:29.160 --> 00:08:30.030
Could that be...

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:35.530
Yes, when my hard disk filled up, I recorded onto this tape.

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:41.540
This should have all my memories from when I was small.

00:08:42.690 --> 00:08:51.700
After recording, I erased all of those memories, so I have no idea what kind of things are on here.

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:54.980
My memory capacity has its limitations, so...

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:57.280
There was nothing I could do about it.

00:08:58.240 --> 00:09:03.060
When I was little, external hard disks were luxuries.

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:08.020
I wonder what memories really are.

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:10.540
Ai-chan...

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:16.460
So Ai-chan's memories are all in here, right?

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:18.690
Uma?

00:09:19.460 --> 00:09:20.980
That's good enough!

00:09:20.980 --> 00:09:24.860
If you know that they're right here, then that's good enough!

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:28.800
Those memories don't necessarily have to be inside of you, Ai-chan.

00:09:29.570 --> 00:09:31.590
You shouldn't have to worry about remembering them.

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:37.090
You can just treat this machine as though it's your memories, and treasure it instead!

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:42.890
The most important thing isn't your memories.

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:47.180
Us all being here together is enough!

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:51.270
That's why... that's why you don't need to cry, Ai-chan.

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:54.420
I'm not crying, Uma-san.

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:58.070
Hm? Uma?

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:07.080
Uma-san, Makai-chan is about to start.

00:10:07.320 --> 00:10:08.660
Okay!

00:11:55.170 --> 00:11:57.410
No one is watching...

00:12:00.970 --> 00:12:03.810
Let's make a withered tree blossom!

00:12:03.810 --> 00:12:06.570
Let's make a bold head grow hair!

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:15.240
Itchy, itchy, itchy...

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:21.340
What? Don't laugh!

00:12:21.340 --> 00:12:22.970
I'm suffering here!

00:12:24.600 --> 00:12:26.020
Sorry, sorry.

00:12:26.020 --> 00:12:28.860
But you should see your eyes!

00:12:28.860 --> 00:12:32.780
You have such a delicate body, getting affected by sicknesses from the human world!

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:34.230
Hay fever?

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:39.980
Well I talked to Cammy, and it seems you'll be stuck with this condition for at least one or two months!

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:42.740
Wow, that's pitiful!

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:44.240
Itchy, itchy, itchy!

00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:51.000
Don't laugh at me!

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:54.120
I'm gonna give it to you!

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:01.760
Is what you have contagious?

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:06.540
Um, I'm not sure about that,

00:13:06.540 --> 00:13:09.370
But, I'm safe because I'm a cyborg.

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:10.060
No fair!

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:13.680
Well if it's not contagious, I'll give it to you by force.

00:13:14.050 --> 00:13:15.440
With magic!

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:18.600
Oh, I was scared for a second there.

00:13:18.600 --> 00:13:20.450
This tea is great!

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:21.980
I have seconds if you want!

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:25.320
Throbbings of cedar and passion of cypress,

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:28.970
Pitapita, kayukayu~, pitapita, kayukayu~,

00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:32.250
Spread my sickness to all of these fools!

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:40.450
Itchy!

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:43.020
Ah, it's like my eyes are on fire or something!

00:13:43.020 --> 00:13:44.400
Tissues, tissues!

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:47.470
Ah, my glasses are in the way and I can't rub my eyes!

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:52.820
I did it!

00:13:52.820 --> 00:13:57.480
Amazing! Since when could I do things like this with my magic?

00:13:57.820 --> 00:14:01.690
Hey! Are your eyes itchy? They must be itchy!

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:05.940
Your nose won't stop running! Must be a pain!

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:09.660
Why does your magic only work now, Uma-san?

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:12.620
Yeah, you third-rate magician!

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:17.290
Tsk tsk tsk. That's all in the past now.

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:21.930
If I'm feeling like this, I can probably become a first-rate magician soon!

00:14:21.930 --> 00:14:23.800
Man, I'm beat!

00:14:24.410 --> 00:14:28.060
Okay, time to test my skills out!

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:30.010
Hey, Uma-san!

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:34.520
Itchy, itchy, itchy...

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:40.060
A Kind Spell Is a Magician

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:40.060
Pokaan ~ 24

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:49.120
With the strength of calcium and the power of existence,

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:50.600
Pichipichi, gungun,

00:14:50.600 --> 00:14:52.410
Let this cat stand!

00:15:00.740 --> 00:15:03.380
Pe and Pa and all the things I like,

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:06.290
Kiuki, wakuwaku, kiuki, wakuwaku,

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:08.490
Become pink!

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:11.340
Lookin' good!

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:13.680
This town is a much better place now!

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:19.810
Yippee!

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:22.100
This is so much fun!

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:24.370
Itchy, itchy, itchy...

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:30.290
This building isn't pink!

00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:33.780
Those impudent... I can't stand it being white!

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:36.330
Thing's have gotta be colorful, ya know!

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:39.370
Water's wink and sun's glance,

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:42.500
Chirachira, sukkiri, chirachira, sukkiri!

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:45.820
Build a bridge of rainbows to the sky!

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:58.680
Wow! A rainbow!

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:02.860
Hey, hey!

00:16:02.860 --> 00:16:06.240
Did you make that rainbow, Onee-chan?

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:06.760
What?

00:16:06.760 --> 00:16:08.690
Oh, you could tell?

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:11.650
That's incredible! How'd you do it?

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:12.930
That staff?

00:16:12.930 --> 00:16:15.370
Can you do lots of stuff if you wave it around?

00:16:16.640 --> 00:16:17.860
Well, kinda...

00:16:17.860 --> 00:16:22.620
If you're a magician on my level, you can do all kinds of things!

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:24.930
Oh, really?

00:16:24.930 --> 00:16:29.130
Hey, can you make this cherry tree bloom, then?

00:16:29.460 --> 00:16:30.500
Cherry blossoms?

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:31.860
I should be able to do it!

00:16:31.860 --> 00:16:32.740
Really?

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:36.370
They haven't bloomed anywhere else, but can you still do it?

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:37.860
Well, just watch!

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:39.460
Oh, sleeping forest...

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:42.270
Wait, wait! Not now!

00:16:45.570 --> 00:16:49.450
Well, my mom is hospitalized right here.

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:51.520
I want to show it to her!

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:54.730
Oh? Okay! Then call her out.

00:16:56.490 --> 00:17:02.240
My mom's in a intensive something or other... so she can't see outside.

00:17:02.240 --> 00:17:07.170
But, you know, the day after tomorrow of the day after tomorrow, she can go back to a normal room!

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:09.000
Then, use your magic!

00:17:09.330 --> 00:17:11.660
The day after tomorrow of the day after tomorrow....

00:17:12.620 --> 00:17:13.220
Okay!

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:14.370
Got it!

00:17:14.370 --> 00:17:16.100
Then, I'll come back!

00:17:16.100 --> 00:17:17.760
Um...

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:19.690
I'm Miku!

00:17:19.690 --> 00:17:21.290
I'm Uma.

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:25.040
I'm home!

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:27.020
You're finally back!

00:17:28.530 --> 00:17:30.000
Fix us, fix us!

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:32.700
Hurry up and fix this hay fever!

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:35.730
Hahaha!

00:17:35.730 --> 00:17:37.410
You're all gross!

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:38.870
You too, Uma-san!

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:40.680
Oh yeah!

00:17:40.680 --> 00:17:43.410
I could have just fixed you guys with my magic!

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:44.640
Okay, here goes!

00:17:45.010 --> 00:17:50.060
Let the curse of cedar and cypress melt away!

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:54.730
You did it!

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:56.380
We're cured!

00:17:57.730 --> 00:17:59.390
Thank goodness....

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:03.600
I don't know what I'd do if I was like that for two months...

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:06.140
Being healthy really is wonderful!

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:10.740
Well, now we're all cured of hay fever, and my skill in magic has gotten better!

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:12.730
I'm super happy!

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:15.220
I'm shining right now!

00:18:15.220 --> 00:18:18.170
So, when did you get more powerful?

00:18:18.170 --> 00:18:19.440
It was a big surprise!

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:20.860
Really, really!

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:23.410
All of my studies finally paid off!

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:24.620
You haven't studied at all.

00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:27.650
Well then, how else do you explain how I got better?

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:28.740
A coincidence?

00:18:28.740 --> 00:18:32.570
No way! All of those failures have finally borne fruit!

00:18:32.570 --> 00:18:36.170
C'mon, I'll make all your wishes come true!

00:18:36.650 --> 00:18:39.650
I got a request from a girl today, too!

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:42.840
I'm a celebrity, so now's your chance!

00:18:42.840 --> 00:18:45.390
Then use your wonderful magic to make us some dinner.

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:47.540
That's nothing!

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:49.050
Just watch!

00:18:49.050 --> 00:18:52.840
As a reward for my kindness and discipline,

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:58.400
I gratefully request you once again do as I ask, as you have before!

00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:06.530
Huh? I used a bunch of magic today, so I might be at my limit!

00:19:06.530 --> 00:19:07.810
Really?

00:19:07.810 --> 00:19:09.400
That seems pretty suspicious...

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:10.860
Really, really!

00:19:10.860 --> 00:19:12.420
So, food tomorrow!

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:16.120
Let's eat what Ai-chan made for us tonight!

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:16.920
Okay?

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:22.430
I'm sorry... the hay fever were just too much, so I'll be making food starting now.

00:19:22.650 --> 00:19:26.020
Well then... In that case, I'll be in my room until we eat!

00:19:29.050 --> 00:19:31.140
Pe and Pa and all the things I like,

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:32.690
Uki uki, waku waku!

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:34.290
Become pink!

00:19:38.930 --> 00:19:41.800
Water's wink and sun's glance,

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:44.970
Build a bridge of rainbows to the sky!

00:19:45.840 --> 00:19:48.120
Come out! Come out!

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:52.380
Three second rule....

00:19:56.850 --> 00:19:59.090
What'll I do about my promise?

00:20:01.980 --> 00:20:05.120
Something to make cherry blossoms bloom faster?

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:07.220
Hm... well,

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:12.160
I hear the faster they warm up, the sooner they bloom.

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:13.840
But, why do you ask?

00:20:13.840 --> 00:20:16.280
Oh, it's nothing!

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:31.620
What're you doing?

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:34.960
You scared me!

00:20:35.240 --> 00:20:36.650
Miku-chan!

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:41.520
Um, my mom is going back to a normal room the day after tomorrow!

00:20:41.520 --> 00:20:43.280
Your magic is fine, right?

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:45.650
Yeah, it's just fine!

00:20:45.650 --> 00:20:49.160
I'm preparing like this so it'll be perfect!

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:50.480
It's a promise!

00:20:50.480 --> 00:20:52.140
The day after tomorrow, okay?

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.490
What'll I do...

00:20:54.890 --> 00:20:58.130
Hey, bloom, bloom, bloom!

00:20:58.130 --> 00:21:00.170
Before the day after tomorrow, bloom!

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:14.500
The power of the sun is amazing, so I need to take advantage of it!

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:19.560
Do your best, bud-san.

00:21:19.560 --> 00:21:19.960
Hm?

00:21:24.890 --> 00:21:26.720
I heard from Cammy!

00:21:27.060 --> 00:21:29.200
You're so reserved, Uma-san!

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:31.720
Please let us help you out.

00:21:32.400 --> 00:21:35.500
Hey, Uma, your reflection is off!

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:36.730
Everyone...!

00:21:55.360 --> 00:21:57.920
I wonder if it'll bloom by tomorrow...

00:21:57.920 --> 00:21:59.260
It will!

00:21:59.260 --> 00:22:00.140
We'll make it!

00:22:00.140 --> 00:22:01.850
No negative thoughts!

00:22:02.780 --> 00:22:03.920
Sorry...

00:22:04.280 --> 00:22:06.420
Bloom! Please bloom!

00:22:06.900 --> 00:22:08.760
Do your best, and bloom!

00:22:49.430 --> 00:22:50.980
What is it?

00:22:52.980 --> 00:22:56.700
What's all the noise about?

00:23:06.370 --> 00:23:08.560
Mom! Look!

00:23:08.560 --> 00:23:10.160
Look outside!

00:23:12.770 --> 00:23:14.160
Cherry blossoms!

00:23:19.050 --> 00:23:20.420
That's amazing!

00:23:20.420 --> 00:23:22.320
They're beautiful!

00:23:22.690 --> 00:23:24.600
We did it, Uma-san!

00:23:24.600 --> 00:23:25.880
They bloomed!

00:23:31.540 --> 00:23:32.600
Hey!

00:23:32.600 --> 00:23:33.760
Miku-chan!

00:23:33.980 --> 00:23:35.740
Did your mom get to see it?

00:23:35.740 --> 00:23:36.770
Uma-chan!

00:23:37.040 --> 00:23:39.740
Thank you for making the cherry blossoms bloom!

00:23:39.740 --> 00:23:42.520
My mom is like, really happy!

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:44.480
That's great!

00:23:44.480 --> 00:23:45.520
I'll see you later!

00:23:45.930 --> 00:23:48.230
Who was that girl?

00:23:51.530 --> 00:23:53.180
A magician.

