gyakugire shichaimashou?

00:24:19.180 --> 00:24:23.840
Why don't I just be an idiot instead?

00:24:24.840 --> 00:24:32.020
san-kyuu wa renkinjutsu

00:24:24.840 --> 00:24:32.020
My alchemy is third rate.

00:24:32.020 --> 00:24:39.430
shuuren datoka mendokusai desu

00:24:32.020 --> 00:24:39.430
Studying and that is just a pain in the neck.

