kankakuteki na atashi de GO!

00:25:15.530 --> 00:25:19.980
Go out with someone who's more sensitive -- me!

00:25:28.130 --> 00:25:31.370
The optimistic nuisance.

00:25:35.550 --> 00:25:39.050
Everyone, gather round! G-A-T-H-E-R R-O-U-N-D!

00:25:39.760 --> 00:25:43.530
Hey, hey, I mastered some magic!

00:25:43.530 --> 00:25:45.220
What kind of magic?

00:25:45.220 --> 00:25:47.970
Magic to make everyone happy!

00:25:47.970 --> 00:25:49.890
Huh? What are you on about?

00:25:49.890 --> 00:25:50.820
Eh?

00:25:50.820 --> 00:25:51.570
It can't exist.

00:25:52.250 --> 00:25:53.120
Eh?!

00:25:53.120 --> 00:25:54.120
It doesn't, it doesn't.

00:25:54.120 --> 00:25:55.420
Eh?!

00:25:55.420 --> 00:25:57.410
You don't have to be that harsh.
